{
  "_id": "fhSubCoalshade01",
  "name": "Coalshade Powder",
  "type": "consumable",
  "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
  "folder": "fhSubFantasy0001",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A jet-black snuff ground from the resin of coalshade trees. A pinch sharpens the senses and steadies the hands; the price is a bone-deep restlessness that lingers for hours.</p><p><strong><em>Desired effects on use.</em></strong> For one hour you have a +2 bonus to Wisdom (Perception) and Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) checks, and you have advantage on initiative rolls.</p><p><strong><em>On use, save against addiction.</em></strong> Make a DC 13 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, you gain the Addicted condition from Coalshade Powder (see below).</p><p><strong><em>Addicted from Coalshade Powder.</em></strong> While you have this Addicted condition, you are also Poisoned and have disadvantage on Wisdom checks.</p><p><strong><em>Withdrawal.</em></strong> At the end of each Long Rest while addicted, you either take another dose or abstain. If you abstain, make a DC 12 Wisdom check to resist the craving; on a failure, make a DC 20 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, you suffer withdrawal for 3 days. If you have no doses left, you must abstain and go straight to the saving throw.</p><p><em>Requires ready paraphernalia that applies to inhaled substances, such as a Snuff Horn.</em></p>"
    },
